# With completed blocks hidden, Alt+k on the first task of a project keeps the task in view instead of burying it in a hidden done project.
file <<END
Old: @done(2026-10-01)
	- finished
Current:
	- Task one
	- Task two
END
keys <C-o>
hide Old:
keys j <A-k>
see ▌   - Task one
quit
saved <<END
Old: @done(2026-10-01)
	- finished
Current:
	- Task one
	- Task two
END
